mpute supply deals, M&A and acquihires,\n      IPO speculation, the capex-bubble debate\n\n  - name: OPEN SOURCE & RESEARCH ECOSYSTEM\n    covers: >-\n      open-weight releases, DeepSeek/Qwen/Kimi/GLM, arXiv papers, Hugging\n      Face leaderboards, NeurIPS/ICML, fine-tuning techniques\n\n  - name: TALENT & ORG DYNAMICS\n    covers: >-\n      researcher moves, lab spinouts, leadership shakeups, compensation\n      wars, Safe Superintelligence, Thinking Machines Lab\n\n  - name: ROBOTICS & EMBODIED AI\n    covers: >-\n      humanoid robots, Figure/Optimus/1X, world models, robot foundation\n      models, Boston Dynamics, embodied AI funding\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27026,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27026},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","uuid":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","timestamp":"2026-09-01T01:01:56.868Z","request_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"}
